---
table {
  --cssv-key: Category;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  width: 100%;
  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  color: #202823;
  background: #ffffff;
}
th, td { padding: 0.8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #d6dedb; text-align: left; }
thead { background: #e9f1ed; }
td.number {
  --cssv-format: "maximumFractionDigits:0,useGrouping:true";
  text-align: right;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
tr:has([data-col="Variance SEK"].positive) { background: #fff1e5; }
[data-col="Variance SEK"].positive { color: #982b17; font-weight: 700; }
[data-col="Variance SEK"].negative { color: #176344; }
---
Category,Planned SEK,Actual SEK,Variance SEK
Equipment,60000,72000,12000
Training,40000,32000,-8000
Travel,30000,39000,9000
Software,50000,48000,-2000
Team events,20000,20000,0
